  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our Rights, Our Lives, Our Future (O3) programme - Phase II - Sweden</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our Rights, Our Lives, Our Future (O3) program supports the delivery of good quality school-based comprehensive sexuality education (CSE), the O3 programme has arguably become the largest CSE programme in sub-Saharan Africa (SSA). The programme aims to empower adolescents and young people (AYP) and build agency, while developing the skills, knowledge, attitudes, and competencies required for preventing HIV, reducing early and unintended pregnancies (EUPs), and eliminating gender-based violence (GBV).</narrative>
  </description>
